    "descriptionAr": "At Uni Systems, we are working towards turning digital visions into reality. We are continuously growing and we are looking for a professional AI & NLP Engineer to join our UniQue Petten, Netherlands team. What will you be bringing to the team? Collect and clean data from various sources. Analyse datasets to identify trends and patterns. Collaborate with stakeholders to understand data needs. Conduct exploratory data analysis to uncover insights. Recommend improvements based on data insights. Present data-driven insights and create actionable, decision-oriented recommendations tailored for non-technical audiences and stakeholders. Requirements What do you need to succeed in this position? Master Degree + minimum 5 years of relevant professional experience Knowledge and expertise on identification, collection, analysis, consolidation and modelling of data relevant to the materials demand and supply chain analysis for strategic technologies; Experience with data visualization and data mapping tools such as Tableau and ArcGIS; Ability to synthesize the result of large dataset analysis into communication and dissemination products such as reports, briefs and/or factsheets. Ability to analyse datasets, detect trends, and deliver evidence-based insights. Ability to resolve data issues and propose actionable improvements. Drive to explore new methods, tools, and data sources proactively. Flexibility to adopt new data platforms, tools, and approaches. Ability to understand, speak and write English. At Uni Systems, we are providing equal employment opportunities and banning any form of discrimination on grounds of gender, religion, race, color, nationality, disability, social class, political beliefs, age, marital status, sexual orientation or any other characteristics. Take a look at our Diversity, Equality & Inclusion Policy for more information. Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow",
